# this is the white list for the junit creation of the coverage (that leads to test fails, when the coverage is too low)
#
# each line represents one file
# syntax:  <filepath>:<allowedCoverage>
#
# <filepath>          should be the end part of the file path
# <allowedCoverage>   set the minimum allowed coverage (in percent) for the file, that will not lead to an test fail
#

# use key word // LCOV_EXCL_START and // LCOV_EXCL_STOP to exclude specific lines of the code

# Example:
